# Netlify response headers for the static export (www.rido.bike).
# GitHub Pages ignores this file; the optional Vercel host does not read it.
#
# Syntax: https://docs.netlify.com/routing/headers/
#
# Caching: everything under /_next/static has a content hash in its name, so
# it is cached for a year and never revalidated. Fonts and images keep stable
# names, so they get shorter lifetimes (rename a font file if you change it).
# HTML and RSC payloads keep Netlify's default (always revalidated), which is
# what makes each deploy visible immediately.
#
# CSP notes for the coverage map (MapLibre GL + OpenFreeMap, keyless):
# - connect-src https://tiles.openfreemap.org — style JSON, glyph PBFs,
#   sprite JSON/PNG, and vector tiles are all fetched via fetch/XHR.
# - img-src https://tiles.openfreemap.org + blob: — decoded tile/sprite
#   bitmaps (already covered by the broad https:, listed for clarity).
# - worker-src 'self' blob: — MapLibre spawns its tile worker from a blob
#   URL; without this the default-src 'self' fallback blocks it.
# - style-src is NOT needed: the map "style" is JSON over fetch, not CSS.
# - No 'unsafe-eval': neither production Next.js nor MapLibre 5 evaluates
#   strings. If the map ever falls back to the static SVG on the live site,
#   check the browser console for a CSP report first.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(self)
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https: https://tiles.openfreemap.org; connect-src 'self' https://tiles.openfreemap.org; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; form-action 'self'

/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000

/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, stale-while-revalidate=86400
